---
layout: base.njk
pagination:
  data: products
  size: 1
  alias: product
permalink: "/en/product/{{ product.id }}/index.html"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ product.nameEn }} — TARA"
  description: "{{ product.descriptionEn }}"
bodyClass: page-product
---
<div class="container"><nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="{% if locale == 'en' %}Breadcrumb{% else %}Brotkrümelnavigation{% endif %}"><a href="{{ localePrefix }}/">{% if locale == 'en' %}Home{% else %}Start{% endif %}</a><span>/</span><a href="{{ localePrefix }}/collection/">Lumière Douce</a><span>/</span>{% if locale == 'en' %}{{ product.nameEn }}{% else %}{{ product.name }}{% endif %}</nav></div>
<section class="product-page"><div class="container"><div class="product-page__layout">
<div class="product-gallery"><div class="product-gallery__main"><button type="button" class="product-gallery__zoom" aria-label="{% if locale == 'en' %}Enlarge product image{% else %}Produktbild vergrößern{% endif %}"><img id="productMainImage" src="{{ product.image }}" alt="{% if locale == 'en' %}{{ product.altEn }}{% else %}{{ product.alt }}{% endif %}" width="1086" height="1448" fetchpriority="high"></button></div>{% if product.hoverImage %}<div class="product-gallery__thumbs"><button class="product-gallery__thumb active" data-src="{{ product.image }}" data-alt="{% if locale == 'en' %}{{ product.altEn }}{% else %}{{ product.alt }}{% endif %}" aria-label="{% if locale == 'en' %}Main view{% else %}Hauptansicht{% endif %}"><img src="{{ product.image }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></button><button class="product-gallery__thumb" data-src="{{ product.hoverImage }}" data-alt="{% if locale == 'en' %}{{ product.hoverAltEn }}{% else %}{{ product.hoverAlt }}{% endif %}" aria-label="{% if locale == 'en' %}Alternate view{% else %}Weitere Ansicht{% endif %}"><img src="{{ product.hoverImage }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></button></div>{% endif %}<p>{% if locale == 'en' %}Illustrative photography. Only the pictured colour is offered in this demo; additional garment views are not yet available.{% else %}Illustrative Fotografie. In dieser Demo ist nur die abgebildete Farbe auswählbar; weitere Kleidungsansichten sind noch nicht verfügbar.{% endif %}</p></div>
<div class="product-info"><p class="product-info__collection"><a href="{{ localePrefix }}/collection/">Lumière Douce · 2026</a></p><h1 class="product-info__name">{% if locale == 'en' %}{{ product.nameEn }}{% else %}{{ product.name }}{% endif %}</h1><p class="product-info__price">€{{ product.price }},00 <small>{% if locale == 'en' %}incl. VAT ·{% else %}inkl. MwSt. ·{% endif %} <a href="#shippingDetails">{% if locale == 'en' %}shipping information{% else %}Versandinformationen{% endif %}</a></small></p><p>{% if locale == 'en' %}{{ product.descriptionEn }}{% else %}{{ product.description }}{% endif %}</p>
<div class="product-info__colors"><p class="product-info__colors-label">{% if locale == 'en' %}Colour{% else %}Farbe{% endif %}: <strong>{% if locale == 'en' %}{{ product.colorOptions[0].labelEn }}{% else %}{{ product.colorOptions[0].label }}{% endif %}</strong></p><div class="product-info__color-options">{% for color in product.colorOptions %}<button type="button" class="product-info__color-swatch product-info__color-swatch--{{ color.token }} active" data-color="{{ color.token }}" aria-pressed="true" aria-label="{% if locale == 'en' %}{{ color.labelEn }}{% else %}{{ color.label }}{% endif %}"></button>{% endfor %}</div></div>
<div class="size-selector"><div class="size-selector__header"><span class="size-selector__label">{% if locale == 'en' %}Size (DE / EU){% else %}Größe (DE / EU){% endif %}</span><a class="size-selector__guide-link" href="{{ localePrefix }}/size-guide/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{% if locale == 'en' %}Size guide (new tab){% else %}Größenberatung (neuer Tab){% endif %}</a></div><div class="size-selector__options">{% for size in product.sizes %}<button type="button" class="size-selector__option" data-size="{{ size }}" aria-pressed="false">{{ size }}</button>{% endfor %}</div></div>
<p class="product-info__model-ref">{% if locale == 'en' %}Demo fit reference: 175 cm, size 38. Model measurements and garment dimensions have not been verified.{% else %}Illustrative Passformreferenz: 175 cm, Größe 38. Model- und Kleidungsmaße sind nicht verifiziert.{% endif %}</p><p id="productSelectionError" role="alert" hidden></p>
<div class="product-info__actions"><div class="qty-selector"><button class="qty-btn" data-action="minus" aria-label="{% if locale == 'en' %}Decrease quantity{% else %}Menge verringern{% endif %}">−</button><input class="qty-input" type="number" value="1" min="1" max="10" aria-label="{% if locale == 'en' %}Quantity{% else %}Menge{% endif %}"><button class="qty-btn" data-action="plus" aria-label="{% if locale == 'en' %}Increase quantity{% else %}Menge erhöhen{% endif %}">+</button></div><button class="btn btn--primary product-info__add-to-cart" data-product-id="{{ product.id }}" data-product-name="{% if locale == 'en' %}{{ product.nameEn }}{% else %}{{ product.name }}{% endif %}" data-product-price="{{ product.price }}" aria-describedby="productSelectionError">{% if locale == 'en' %}Add to bag{% else %}In den Warenkorb{% endif %}</button><button class="product-info__wishlist-btn" data-product-id="{{ product.id }}" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="{% if locale == 'en' %}Save product{% else %}Produkt merken{% endif %}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78L12 21.23l8.84-8.84a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"/></svg></button></div>
<p>{% if locale == 'en' %}Demo product: no orders or payments. Specifications and availability are illustrative.{% else %}Demoprodukt: keine Bestellungen oder Zahlungen. Produktangaben und Verfügbarkeit sind illustrativ.{% endif %}</p>
<div class="accordion"><details class="accordion__item" open><summary class="accordion__header">{% if locale == 'en' %}Materials & care{% else %}Materialien & Pflege{% endif %}</summary><div class="accordion__body"><div class="accordion__content"><p>{% if locale == 'en' %}Illustrative composition: {{ product.compositionEn }}{% else %}Illustrative Zusammensetzung: {{ product.composition }}{% endif %}</p><p>{% if locale == 'en' %}{{ product.careEn }}{% else %}{{ product.care }}{% endif %}</p></div></div></details><details class="accordion__item"><summary class="accordion__header">{% if locale == 'en' %}Fit & sizing{% else %}Passform & Größe{% endif %}</summary><div class="accordion__body"><div class="accordion__content"><p>{% if locale == 'en' %}{{ product.fitEn }}{% else %}{{ product.fit }}{% endif %}</p>{% include "size-table.njk" %}</div></div></details><details class="accordion__item"><summary class="accordion__header">{% if locale == 'en' %}Origin & transparency{% else %}Herkunft & Transparenz{% endif %}</summary><div class="accordion__body"><div class="accordion__content"><p>{% if locale == 'en' %}TARA is a fictional brand concept. Suppliers, country of origin and certifications have not been verified. We make no certified organic or water-saving claims.{% else %}TARA ist ein fiktives Markenkonzept. Lieferanten, Herkunftsländer und Zertifikate sind nicht verifiziert. Wir machen keine belegten Bio- oder Wassersparversprechen.{% endif %}</p><a href="{{ localePrefix }}/materials/">{% if locale == 'en' %}About the materials{% else %}Mehr zu den Materialien{% endif %}</a></div></div></details><details class="accordion__item" id="shippingDetails"><summary class="accordion__header">{% if locale == 'en' %}Shipping & returns{% else %}Versand & Rückgabe{% endif %}</summary><div class="accordion__body"><div class="accordion__content"><p>{% if locale == 'en' %}Planned service: DHL delivery in Germany, free from €{{ site.commerce.freeShippingThreshold }}. Voluntary free returns within 30 days, in addition to the 14-day statutory withdrawal period. This demo does not ship orders.{% else %}Geplanter Service: DHL-Versand in Deutschland, kostenlos ab {{ site.commerce.freeShippingThreshold }} €. Freiwillige kostenlose Rückgabe innerhalb von 30 Tagen, zusätzlich zum gesetzlichen Widerrufsrecht von 14 Tagen. Diese Demo versendet keine Bestellungen.{% endif %}</p><a href="{{ localePrefix }}/legal/widerruf/">{% if locale == 'en' %}Withdrawal information{% else %}Widerrufsbelehrung{% endif %}</a></div></div></details></div></div></div></div></section>
